  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="py-5 bg-light-grey" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="heading-border heading-center mb-3 pb-3 d-inline-block">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-10 mx-auto">
          <div class="accordion legal-industry-faq" id="legalIndustryFaq">
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind1">Can AI really review legal documents accurately?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">AI is a powerful tool for document analysis, but it should augment, not replace, attorney judgment. Our systems flag clauses, identify risks, and extract key terms; attorneys review the AI’s output and make final decisions. Think of it as a highly efficient first-pass reviewer that never gets tired.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind2">How do you ensure attorney-client privilege is protected?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We build privilege protection into the architecture: encrypted communications, access controls limiting who sees what, complete audit trails, and secure cloud infrastructure. We also help you establish proper IT policies and train staff on privilege considerations with technology.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind3">What if the AI makes a mistake or misses something critical?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">AI is not perfect, and we’re transparent about that. Attorney review is always required for critical decisions. Our systems include confidence scores, highlighting uncertain analysis for closer human review. We maintain liability insurance and work with you to establish proper review protocols.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind4">Can you integrate with our existing legal research platforms?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We integrate with Westlaw, LexisNexis, Fastcase, Casetext, and other legal research platforms. We can pull research results, citations, and case law into our tools. For proprietary platforms, we can build custom integrations.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind5">How much does legal technology implementation cost?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Costs vary by firm size and scope. Basic document automation starts around $20–40K. Comprehensive practice management with AI features ranges from $80–200K+. We offer phased implementations and can often show ROI within 3–6 months from increased billable hours.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind6">Do we need to change how we practice law?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Not drastically. We design technology to fit your existing workflows. However, technology may reveal better ways of doing things, faster document review, better client communication, more efficient matter management. We work collaboratively to adopt technology at your pace.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind7">What about ethics and bar association approval?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We stay current on ABA ethics opinions and state bar guidance on legal technology, cloud computing, AI, and confidentiality. We help you review applicable ethics rules and implement technology in compliance with professional responsibility obligations. Most state bars encourage technology adoption when done properly.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind8">Can technology help us offer alternative fee arrangements?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. Technology reduces time spent on commodity tasks, making flat fees and other AFAs more profitable. Better matter budgeting and tracking help you predict costs accurately. Many firms use technology to become more cost-competitive while maintaining or increasing profitability.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind9">How long until we see ROI from legal technology?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind9" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Most firms see positive ROI within 3–6 months. Benefits include: billable hours recovered, faster case/matter resolution, improved collections, reduced overhead, and competitive advantage. We help you track metrics to demonstrate clear ROI.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#legind10" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="legind10">Do you provide ongoing support after implementation?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="legind10" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#legalIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We offer ongoing support including software updates, bug fixes, technical support, ethics compliance monitoring, and feature enhancements. We provide training for new attorneys and staff, and can manage systems on your behalf if desired.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

